ARCHITECTURE DIRECTORY (tam-edit)

This folder is for architecture notes. It documents the internal data
structures, memory ownership models, and core algorithms used in our C11
implementation of tam-edit, as well as architectural trade-offs under the
Tamlinux philosophy (pure C11, minimal dependencies, libtam-only linkage,
and first-class Linux virtual console support).

Contents:

- tam-edit.md : Data structures and algorithms implemented in src/.
